Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally come out, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to avenge your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's most impressive is that you\Nalso found the time to track me down. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly kill you to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think we should\Nstart with this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to rethink.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Descend now and not only will you live,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be given the\Nchance to serve me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could choose to rise forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you'd be ascending to your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the two of us first met,\Nfear consumed me like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave your evil Card blanche\Nto manipulate me like a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fear was the beginning of a\Nfutile existence with no end in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a fate worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wretched life devoid of any desire\Nother than doing your bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that fear has been eradicated,\Nleaving only the burning will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent 45 days traveling with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others\Nand in honor of those who
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Died on that journey,\NI'll never fear you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My aren't we confident climb these\Nstairs and put that bravado to the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the interesting decision Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've backed down after\Nall is that your clever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way of telling me you\Nwant your former life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:01:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I went up the stairs. I'm\Nsure. What happened? Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be shaken, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.34,0:02:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could the winds of fear have\Nextinguished your burning resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the only steps you\Ntook were in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in actuality, fear\Noverrode your consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrestling control from your brain\Ncausing you to descend down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I just\Nwalked up those stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he doing this with his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's stand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.54,0:02:55.38,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola, Ola, Ola, Ola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola, Ola, Ola, Ola!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.67,0:04:26.18,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,689)\pos(135,858)}Episode 45: Dio's World, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered what\Nthe human soul desires most?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subconsciously, all humans\Nwish to overcome their fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seek fame, money,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and dominance of others, all to obtain\Na sense of everlasting security.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They create bonds as a\Nmeans of self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they wish to help others\Npurely for the sake of love and justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's only to settle\Ntheir feeble minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humanity's greatest desire\Nis to attain serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why refuse to serve me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What greater serenity is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to me and all I\Nspeak of will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no point in running\Nheadlong into a meaningless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seriously letting\Nhim draw me back in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a talented stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn your back on Joestar\Nand live as my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you unending peace starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haftal, Iggy, I need your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the bullshit, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already stared death in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll gladly do it again if it\Nhelps uncover your stand's abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to meet your end, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's your stand the world! Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you something first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only out in the open for a moment\Nor two, but I saw him use his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't actually see it, but I\Ndid feel it in a manner of speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's complicated, but here's\Nthe long and short of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was heading up the stairs\Nto beat the life out of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that bastard when suddenly\NI was back where I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I know what I'm saying\Ndoesn't make any sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wrap my head around\Nwhat happened either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm losing my mind over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he wasn't using\Nany sort of hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say super speed, but there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is that I sense\Nsomething utterly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are Iggy and Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't make it. They're both dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They died trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go. Look, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, the sun is setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. All right, out with\Nit. What's waiting for us upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the the towers there's also another\Nroom at the top it's where lord
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dio dwells during the day is there\Nanother staircase to the tower no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is the only set of stairs that\Nleads there in that case lead the way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's him. The two of us\Nhave never met, but I've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about this monster for longer\Nthan i care to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how could i not know this\Nfiend the thought of him has
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been burned into my mind ever\Nsince the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same for Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd hoped this day would never come,\Nthat we'd never have to face Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as Joestars, we knew we'd\Neventually have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came on this journey\Nof my own free will,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can live with whatever\Nhappens from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen things more clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a light of\Nclarity has washed over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are that light,\Nwhile Dio is darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body may be broken and battered,\Nbut the fear has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virtue and light has purified my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll attack the moment Dio steps\Nout of the coffin. Stay at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what tricks\Nhe has up his sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens,\Nordeal, you have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never betrayed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only led these\Ndegenerates here because I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knew you had the power to\Neasily dispose of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As certain as a man wetting\Nhimself when pissing in the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your victory is assured\Nyou are all-powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't be angry with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of the groveling!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the damn coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give these bastards a\Ncruel and horrifying end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord DIO! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd I get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just opening the coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes were locked on\NLoser Boy the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anyone else see him get in the coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did someone put him\Nin there without us knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was watching him just like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's opening the coffin one second\Nand the next he's inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't believe it's a mind trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not super speed\Neither. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he playing games with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what was that feeling back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ominous presence it was\Ngiving off was far more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than any stand our group\Nhas ever encountered before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like knowing a\Nbulldozer is coming after
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just from the sound\Nof its roaring engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sensed it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An insane lust to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like somebody\Nshoving an icicle up my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't escaped when we did, whatever\Nthat was would have killed us for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost gone below the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio will have the advantage in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me you guys are\Nplanning to run away and hide until dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:11:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finishing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm packing\Nup and heading for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to see this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get this over\Nwith as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the tide of battle has turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While not up close, we\Nface to stand the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we still have no\Nidea what its powers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fighting blind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like mountain climbing\Nwithout knowing the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try to fight Dio\Nright now, we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fact is as inevitable as burping\Nafter knocking back a couple of colas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio would be a fool not\Nto come racing after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he only has until sunrise to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to learn the extent of his stance\Npower and find a way to put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can just hold out until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going back on my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and Iggy died\Nbecause of my weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go to hell and back to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all I won't do is run\Naway from my obligation! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Polnareff! Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what do you\Nthink we should do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went down there to fight Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we retreat, we'll also be fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means we'll be attacking\Nfrom both sides at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, let us buy this truck off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This baby's my bread and butter. No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buckle up, cock-o-een.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think I'll just run till dawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've crossed the wrong Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll settle this on my own if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I don't know\Nhow Dio's stand works?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just find another way to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had them let you go because convincing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stubborn guys like you\Nis a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the old man in Kakyoin insisted\NI stay close and watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
