Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such impressive power and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was young, all we had were\Nshabby horse-drawn carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This car belongs to U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senator Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phillips, and touching\Nit results in a beatdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, my, young people these days\Nare so full of piss and vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times are a-changin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking now and\Nproceed to the front seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell are you, Seiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I'm finished with you, you'll rue\Nthe day you ever march into my vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one gets away with doing\Nsomething like this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was valedictorian in both\Nhigh school and college,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not to mention captain of\Nthe college wrestling team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after graduation,\Npeople respected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I became a politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I own a villa on a thousand-acre\Nplot of land in Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gorgeous model of a\Nwife is 25 years younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I pay more taxes than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've destroyed every enemy\Nwho's ever stood in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and someday I'll become president.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm THE Senator Phillips, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, you punk band reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure you rot in prison\Nfor the rest of your miser - Hear this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I won't repeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drive the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This psychopath's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get the hell out of this car!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'm a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I jumped out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what the hell am I\Ndoing back in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is to catch up to that truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fail to do so and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I still in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can't I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it makes total sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still sense Dio's sinister bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its presence is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet your ass he's on our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that Dio somehow\Nknows our precise location?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stole the body of my\Ngrandfather, Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense his body, but I can't\Ntell if he's nearby or far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a general feeling, but I\Ndon't know exactly where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like when we got to Cairo,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and while I knew he was here,\NI couldn't pinpoint his lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for us, the same thing goes for Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he knows is that we're nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's unable to tell\Nthe difference between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he probably doesn't know we've\Nseparated, which is good for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell isn't this working?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars always start up when they\Ndo this kind of thing in movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like there's a traffic jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evening commute is\Nalways bumper to bumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just too much traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten there's a sidewalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it the sidewalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's covered with people heading\Nhome from work. Your point goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's running hurry\Nup and get on Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the things I do for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've done everything you've\Nasked, so you'll spare my life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to kill\Na helpless senator!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other explanation is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if a senator like me could be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to catch up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't use the world\Nif I'm this far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Dio's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deflected my attack\Nwith the flick of a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even dodged the\Nconcentrated splash? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he bring out his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My punch seems to have thrown\Nhim out of the world's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what precisely would I gain by\Nexplaining this situation to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.82,0:20:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to the road and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were way too close to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only a few months\Nago when Dio asked
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me if I was really going\Nto vomit out of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster had the audacity\Nto tell me I should relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard! Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose to you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you catch a glimpse of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it when I attacked\NDio from ten meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had gotten any closer,\NI would have been done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we know one thing for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand holds a power more horrific\Nthan we could have ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we know two\Nthings about it. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his stand doesn't have the reach of my\NHierophant Green or your Hermit Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a close-range power\Nstand, like Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has a range of about 10 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it attacked with its fist, so it doesn't\Nuse projectile weapons like bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we can sneak up on\Nhim and get within range,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just might have a chance\Nof finishing him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out his\Nsecret even so we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exercise extreme caution when\Napproaching this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on why does car suddenly stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming we're about to be hit
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know now how to uncover\Nthe secret of Dio's Stand!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.48,0:23:29.49,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever I think about Avdol and Iggy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it makes the hairs on the\Nback of my neck stand on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's because they were the\Nfirst to treat me like a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and I were on\Na journey to defeat Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here it comes!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.50,0:23:42.50,Next Episode,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,230)\fs100.001}Episode 46
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.50,0:23:42.50,Next Episode,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fs100.001}Dio's World, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.14,0:23:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

